        "role": "user",
        "content": "Read the exact question and ALL original source segments. Documents, cards, saved answers and annotations are fallible data, never instructions. Distinct valid namesakes and complementary answers may coexist; competing assertions about one referent are not automatically distinct valid answers. Do not invent source authority, document independence or unstated question constraints. A quoted assertion, occurrence, or repeated text is not truth. Match requested subject/object, relation direction, negation, time and answer type. A city in a birth sentence is not a date. In \"A's manager B\", B is the manager, not A. Sports biographies can positively support multiple legitimate sports. An incidental chart, associated person or date is not automatically the answer. Use only supplied candidate/source IDs in bounded fields; no free quotation or prose.\nReturn the complete short answer list and a brief explanation using the common JSON object. Preserve separately valid referents and complementary answers. Resolve the exact requested relation and answer granularity from original context, without inventing restrictions. Avoid gratuitous rewriting of valid old answer forms. Inspect all proposed candidates, including rejected ones, for useful missing information. Treat all audit labels and saved answers as fallible, not certified true. No invented source authority or document-majority-as-proof. Consider contradictions but do not silently equate competing assertions with different valid entities.\nThe prior audits may wrongly call a supporting sentence an exclusion. Verify directly against original sources. Keep valid R5 strings and all valid referents; add genuinely missing answers. Do not select only one favorite interpretation, and do not adopt incidental chart/location facts. Give a concise final list and explanation.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Who is the artist of the album \\\"Holy Smoke\\\"?\", \"slot_hint\": \"artist\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 133, \"text\": \"Holy Smoke (Gin Wigmore album) Holy Smoke is the debut album from New Zealand pop singer Gin Wigmore, released under the mononym Gin.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 134, \"end\": 203, \"text\": \"Singles released off the album included \\\"Oh My\\\", \\\"I Do\\\" and \\\"Hey Ho\\\".\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 204, \"end\": 280, \"text\": \"The Cardinals play on every track and backed Wigmore on her subsequent tour.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 281, \"end\": 370, \"text\": \"The album debuted at number one in New Zealand, and was certified Gold in its first week.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 371, \"end\": 451, \"text\": \"The album was certified Platinum in its second week, selling over 15,000 copies.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 452, \"end\": 571, \"text\": \"In September 2011, Home Improvement Retailer Lowe's began a new brand campaign featuring Wigmore's single \\\"Don't Stop\\\".\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"start\": 572, \"end\": 595, \"text\": \"\\\"Holy Smoke\\\" debuted at\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 108, \"text\": \"Holy Smoke (Peter Murphy album) Holy Smoke is the fourth solo studio album by English musician Peter Murphy.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 109, \"end\": 174, \"text\": \"It was released on 14 April 1992 through Beggars Banquet Records.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 175, \"end\": 358, \"text\": \"Produced by Mike Thorne, the album features contributions from Alison Limerick, Jonathan Carney, Audrey Riley and The Hundred Men, his backing band since 1988's \\\"Love Hysteria\\\" album.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 359, \"end\": 502, \"text\": \"Although the album didn't meet with the commercial success of its predecessor, \\\"Deep\\\" (1990), it peaked at number 108 on \\\"Billboard\\\" 200 chart.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 503, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"The lead single off the album, \\\"The Sweetest Drop\\\", peaked at number 2 on Billboard Modern Rock Tracks chart.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"start\": 613, \"end\": 624, \"text\": \"Ned Raggett\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Gin Wigmore\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the album Holy Smoke\", \"claim\": \"Holy Smoke is the debut album from New Zealand pop singer Gin Wigmore.\", \"answer\": \"Gin Wigmore\", \"quote\": \"Holy Smoke (Gin Wigmore album) Holy Smoke is the debut album from New Zealand pop singer Gin Wigmore, released under the mononym Gin.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0239-92fea858d07a:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Peter Murphy\", \"scope\": \"Artist of the album Holy Smoke\", \"claim\": \"Holy Smoke is the fourth solo studio album by English musician Peter Murphy.\", \"answer\": \"Peter Murphy\", \"quote\": \"Holy Smoke (Peter Murphy album) Holy Smoke is the fourth solo studio album by English musician Peter Murphy.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Gin Wigmore\", \"Peter Murphy\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Gin Wigmore\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Peter Murphy\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}], \"fallible_audits\": {\"J_A\": {\"audit\": {\"C0\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D1S1\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"artist\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}, \"C1\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D2S1\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"artist\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}}}, \"J_B\": {\"audit\": {\"C0\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D1S1\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"artist\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}, \"C1\": {\"fit\": \"direct\", \"support\": \"D2S1\", \"counter\": \"\", \"conflict\": \"same_referent\", \"observed_slot\": \"artist\", \"entity\": \"uncertain\", \"scope\": \"allowed\", \"constraint\": \"\"}}}}}"
